      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warrenton%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Warrenton gained prominence in the early nineteenth century as the final encampment of the historic Lewis and Clark Expedition.",
